reading the large amount of spoor you lojbanists leave behind. :P

Also, I am (nominally) female. Thus implying that my harem would,
indeed, be formed of masculine components. Although, for various
reasons, they need not be sexual in nature.

And Michael: It could be argued that training an AI is equivalent to
making it, but the idea is to get it to bootstrap that process as much
as possible, so that the training comes not so much from
trainer-guided input and processing as from self-supervised input and
processing. I mean, sure, someone'd have to create the kernel that's
capable of this. Like making babies, I suppose. But the kid (the AI,
in theory) teaches itself with mostly indirect guidance. Explicity
telling a kid (or an AI) how to grow up, instruction by instruction,
would be... tedious, painstaking, even (as mentioned before)
herculean. *shrug*

Bah, it's all science fiction anyway. At least for the next 20 years. 
^_~

